    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφήρης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραρίσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fitted</i> or <i>joined on both sides;</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα ἀ.</span> wood of the funeral pyre
				<i>regularly piled all round,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				243
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σκηναί</span>
			 dwellings <i>well secured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέσσω</span>) <i>with oars on both sides,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. δόρυ</span>
			<i>sculling</i>-boat, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
